{{- if and getGitHubRepo shouldGenerateReleaseFiles -}}
{{- /* The quick-install one-liners fetch scripts/install.sh|ps1, which only
       exist — and only have released binaries to install — when the release
       pipeline (goreleaser + release workflow) is generated. */ -}}
### Quick Install (Linux/macOS)

```bash
curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/{{getGitHubRepo}}/main/scripts/install.sh | bash
```

### Quick Install (Windows PowerShell)

```powershell
iwr -useb https://raw.githubusercontent.com/{{getGitHubRepo}}/main/scripts/install.ps1 | iex
```

{{- if isHomebrewEnabled }}
### Homebrew (macOS/Linux)

```bash
{{getHomebrewInstallCommand}}
```

{{- end }}

{{- if isWingetEnabled }}
### WinGet (Windows)

```powershell
{{getWingetInstallCommand}}
```

{{- end }}

{{- if isNFPMEnabled }}
### Linux Packages

Download Linux packages from the [releases page](https://github.com/{{getGitHubRepo}}/releases).

{{- if or (hasNFPMFormat "deb") (hasNFPMFormat "rpm") }}
```bash
{{- if hasNFPMFormat "deb" }}
sudo dpkg -i {{sanitizeCliName}}_*_amd64.deb
{{- end }}
{{- if hasNFPMFormat "rpm" }}
sudo rpm -i {{sanitizeCliName}}_*_amd64.rpm
{{- end }}
```
{{- end }}

{{- end }}

### Go Install

Alternatively, install directly via Go:

```bash
go install {{getGolangPackage}}/cmd/{{sanitizeCliName}}@latest
```

### Manual Download

Download pre-built binaries for your platform from the [releases page](https://github.com/{{getGitHubRepo}}/releases).
{{- else -}}
To install the CLI, use `go install`:
```bash
go install {{getGolangPackage}}/cmd/{{sanitizeCliName}}@latest
```

Or download a pre-built binary from the [releases page](https://{{getRootModulePath}}/releases) if available.
{{- end -}}
